{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1000_p", "source_sha256": "49e132c546d4cd960c3ca9d6d36b55ffa4792ae9eba6fad211020160cce6a0f3", "ja": "（肝試し遊園地の撮影が終わり、帰る時間になった。\nなのに、環の姿が見えない。一体どこに……）", "zh": "（试胆游乐园的拍摄结束了，也到了回去的时间。可是，却看不到环的身影。她到底去哪儿了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "1900be5491b4d8bdc8d2b31de4a94d633888e5639ad851b4eb18ba8891b992b8", "ja": "あっ、おやぶん！　ここにいた～！", "zh": "啊，大将！原来你在这里～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1002_p", "source_sha256": "adfaf11d4700560704b2420867583fd46bc6131f6d106f518afde273879f0473", "ja": "環！　はあ、よかった……。\nそれにしても、どこに行ってたんだ？", "zh": "环！啊，太好了……\n不过话说回来，你跑哪儿去了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "ce37c07a77c0054eedc1f398feb5bde624422eac4e4340d81d8d0ba985265632", "ja": "ごめんね、おやぶん。\n友達と遊んでたら遅くなっちゃった……。", "zh": "对不起啦，老大。\n和朋友玩着玩着就回来晚了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1004_p", "source_sha256": "fbda13e8ed0e098629d89eac1c4d6ee24215e5418adc5f532ef49041b0427904", "ja": "友達……？　知り合いがいたのか？", "zh": "朋友……？你还有认识的人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "49c7f2c9cc7770365fbb2448ec6940850fb5cb4862c4a61758f838b8d529c7a6", "ja": "ううん、知らない子。歩いてたら、\n「ふたりで遊ぼう！」って誘われたんだ！", "zh": "不是哦，是不认识的孩子。我走着走着，她邀请我说：\n“我们一起玩吧！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "cfe747b5d81131af41c565600c6829c070c0834c9243722f7042b4951d9e19c2", "ja": "このへんに住んでるって言ってた。\nたまきと同い年くらいの女の子だったよ！", "zh": "她说自己就住在这附近。\n是个和环差不多大的女孩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0562bd58420465d5ff4ea7249bb20f861341feaf36ccb320a0ec2375f3879aea", "ja": "そうだったのか。まさか迷子じゃないよな？\nその子、ひとりだったのか？", "zh": "原来是这样。她该不会是迷路了吧？\n那孩子是一个人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "729108a372353cdbd4e44545a6ce0a2efc166bb55aaa931325e64a9eb4032154", "ja": "うん。\nでもね、遊園地のこと、すっごく詳しかったんだ！", "zh": "嗯。\n不过呢，她超级了解游乐园里的事哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "2d0f76bd1d410e92843083b3bcef860c7d1b6b7436bc5256225d264b6f85403c", "ja": "秘密の場所とか、べんりな抜け道とか……\nいーっぱい教えてくれて、ふたりで探検してたんだ♪", "zh": "秘密地点啦，还有方便的近路什么的……\n他告诉了我好多好多，我们两个还一起去探险了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4122b8dddec26ccb4b50f09def8ba813d9fdca9680af313720e68e9fa8284881", "ja": "探検って……そうか。\nまあ、何事もなかったなら安心したよ。", "zh": "探险啊……这样啊。\n嗯，没发生什么事就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "fc0a8226b0e0e6eef16a84ab0460f9d529004296f1bcdd3fd2bc1dee4d812119", "ja": "くふふ、とっても楽しかったぞ！　でも別れる時、\n「劇場に遊びに来て」って言ったんだけど……。", "zh": "咕呼呼，特别开心！不过分别的时候，我说了“要来剧场玩哦”，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "db48caa370280d82c77c7609ede813658fad3a2bcc3597bbdef3137d4497c8d6", "ja": "あんまり遠くには行けないんだって。\nだから、ダメみたい。", "zh": "说是不能去太远的地方。\n所以，好像不行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5374f03b76e041c05e349f89a7a87609aeb68d14497c0522a0d3dc58eb93ef1d", "ja": "……遠くに行けない？", "zh": "……去不了太远的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "a34cb6aa3e50621258b4409405ecb723e72cb18e1cf14554ed46f740f5120f38", "ja": "うん……。こぶんのこと紹介したかったのに、\nちょっと残念……。", "zh": "嗯……本来还想介绍我的小弟给你认识的，可惜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "01dc22d9cfd3d4aaa4f39e4d3ab923760d88e620e0f60bae7e2244cf7ed421eb", "ja": "でも約束したの！　たまきがまた遊びに来るねって。\nそしたら、その子すっごく喜んでたんだ。くふふ♪", "zh": "可是我们约好了！我说下次还会再来找她玩。结果那孩子可高兴了。嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0633_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6e0167b5f7e0593ccddd221b34e819c9cc0e9796e8df102ab8bd711f36a4d935", "ja": "（もしかして、その女の子って……。\nいや、環が楽しかったのならよかった……のかな？）", "zh": "（难道那个女孩就是……\n不，环玩得开心就好……吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
